    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/82474da5c27a9fdab0d5684ce41b3018.avif?t=1747190423\" width=616 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and bring classic 16-bit gaming adventures to life with our intuitive, visual scripting game engine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by your favorite \u201cBlast Processing\u201d-powered system, this engine allows both beginners and experienced creators to build authentic, nostalgic games effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/e17370ad7f334192384561f46e621a33.poster.avif?t=1747190423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/e17370ad7f334192384561f46e621a33.webm?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/e17370ad7f334192384561f46e621a33.mp4?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its easy-to-use, drag-and-drop event system, you can design diverse game experiences without writing a single line of code. Create thrilling platformers, intense shooters, immersive action RPGs and even combine multiple genres in a single game! Let your imagination run wild as you craft engaging worlds, memorable characters, and compelling narratives\u2014in all their 16-bit glory! Just like they did it back in the day\u2014 only a lot easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/ab1d5e6472be0cdc381c9f23224878b9.poster.avif?t=1747190423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/ab1d5e6472be0cdc381c9f23224878b9.webm?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/ab1d5e6472be0cdc381c9f23224878b9.mp4?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our integrated Debugger gives you complete control, allowing you to monitor palettes, global and local variables, actor positions, and game logic in real-time. Perfect your gameplay, optimize performance, and polish your mechanics with powerful debugging tools at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Scripting: Quickly prototype and refine gameplay using intuitive drag-and-drop events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Graphics: Craft visually authentic 16-bit games effortlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile Gameplay Creation: Easily build platformers, shooters, action RPGs, puzzle games, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Debugging: Real-time insights into palettes, variables, actor coordinates, and event logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner-Friendly, Expert-Ready: Accessible to newcomers yet robust enough for seasoned game developers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export and Play on Original Hardware: Easily export your games, burn them to cartridges, and enjoy your creations on original retro hardware. The games have been tested so far on Sega Mega Drive 1 (JP NTCS), 2 (PAL), and Genesis 3 (NTCS) original models, as well as with Retron3 HD and MegaSG consoles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Web Export: Export your game to HTML5 and upload it to the internet for everyone to see!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Integration: Export for Windows with full support for Steam, including Steam Achievements to enhance your game's reach and player engagement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/82474da5c27a9fdab0d5684ce41b3018.avif?t=1747190423\" width=616 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and bring classic 16-bit gaming adventures to life with our intuitive, visual scripting game engine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by your favorite \u201cBlast Processing\u201d-powered system, this engine allows both beginners and experienced creators to build authentic, nostalgic games effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/e17370ad7f334192384561f46e621a33.poster.avif?t=1747190423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/e17370ad7f334192384561f46e621a33.webm?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/e17370ad7f334192384561f46e621a33.mp4?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its easy-to-use, drag-and-drop event system, you can design diverse game experiences without writing a single line of code. Create thrilling platformers, intense shooters, immersive action RPGs and even combine multiple genres in a single game! Let your imagination run wild as you craft engaging worlds, memorable characters, and compelling narratives\u2014in all their 16-bit glory! Just like they did it back in the day\u2014 only a lot easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/ab1d5e6472be0cdc381c9f23224878b9.poster.avif?t=1747190423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/ab1d5e6472be0cdc381c9f23224878b9.webm?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706620/extras/ab1d5e6472be0cdc381c9f23224878b9.mp4?t=1747190423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our integrated Debugger gives you complete control, allowing you to monitor palettes, global and local variables, actor positions, and game logic in real-time. Perfect your gameplay, optimize performance, and polish your mechanics with powerful debugging tools at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Scripting: Quickly prototype and refine gameplay using intuitive drag-and-drop events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Graphics: Craft visually authentic 16-bit games effortlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile Gameplay Creation: Easily build platformers, shooters, action RPGs, puzzle games, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Debugging: Real-time insights into palettes, variables, actor coordinates, and event logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner-Friendly, Expert-Ready: Accessible to newcomers yet robust enough for seasoned game developers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export and Play on Original Hardware: Easily export your games, burn them to cartridges, and enjoy your creations on original retro hardware. The games have been tested so far on Sega Mega Drive 1 (JP NTCS), 2 (PAL), and Genesis 3 (NTCS) original models, as well as with Retron3 HD and MegaSG consoles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Web Export: Export your game to HTML5 and upload it to the internet for everyone to see!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Integration: Export for Windows with full support for Steam, including Steam Achievements to enhance your game's reach and player engagement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
